OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin cloudy
OL,6,Fwith rain. This will clear in the east
OL,7,Fduring the early afternoon and become
OL,8,Flight and patchy towards the evening.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FRain in the west at first
OL,11,Fotherwise dry with clear spells in the
OL,12,Fevening. Cloud will spread east from
OL,13,Fthe late evening with rain following
OL,14,Ftowards the morning.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FCloudy with rain at first,
OL,17,Fsome heavy. The rain clears in the
OL,18,Fnorth where bright spells increase
OL,19,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
